# 🌲 FamilyRoots Platform ("Family Together") — Comprehensive Project Overview & Architecture Guide

**Document File:** `PROJECT_FULL_OVERVIEW_AND_ARCHITECTURE_DOCUMENTATION.doc`  
**Generated Date:** 2026-10-15  
**Projects Covered:** 
- Backend: `d:\Projects\family-together-backend` (NestJS 11 + Prisma 7 + PostgreSQL + Redis)
- Frontend: `d:\Projects\family-together-frontend` (Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 + RTK Query + TailwindCSS v4)

---

## 1. 📌 Executive Summary & Product Vision

**FamilyRoots** (internally designated **Family Together**) is an enterprise-grade, privacy-first, multi-generational family tree, lineage management, and digital heritage preservation platform.

The core mission of FamilyRoots is to provide families with a private, invite-only digital sanctuary where they can:
1. **Visualize Complex Lineages:** Render interactive, zoomable, multi-generational family trees with biological, marital, and adoptive connections.
2. **Preserve Stories & Memories:** Curate rich multi-media galleries (photos, audio recordings, video stories) tied to individual ancestors or entire family branches.
3. **Prevent Duplicate Records:** Leverage an intelligent real-time relative deduplication engine that stops duplicate ancestor entries before they fragment the family tree.
4. **Coordinate Events & RSVPs:** Schedule reunions, birthdays, anniversaries, and memorial gatherings with real-time attendee tracking.
5. **Secure Vault Documents:** Safely store high-resolution legal certificates, wills, citizenship records, and heirlooms with up to 100MB per file payload capacity.
6. **Granular Privacy & Multi-Tenancy:** Enforce strict data isolation so no family's data, photos, or lineage records can ever bleed into or be viewed by another family.

---

## 2. 🏛️ High-Level System Architecture

FamilyRoots is engineered as a decoupled modern full-stack web application:

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   Next.js 16 Client (App Router)                       │
│        React 19 • Redux Toolkit (RTK Query Cache) • Tailwind CSS v4    │
│            Interactive 2D Canvas Family Tree Lineage Engine            │
└───────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                                    │ HTTPS REST APIs + JWT Bearer / Cookie
┌───────────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│                       NestJS 11 REST API Server                        │
│            Modular Architecture • Passport JWT • Swagger OpenAPI       │
│           Role-Based Access Control Guards (Owner, Admin, Member)      │
└───────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┬────────────────┘
                    │                                   │
┌───────────────────▼──────────────────┐   ┌────────────▼───────────────┐
│     PostgreSQL Database (Neon)       │   │        Redis Cache         │
│  Prisma ORM 7 Multi-Schema Partition │   │  Session & Blacklist Cache │
│ (base, family, person, rel, vault)   │   │  OTP & Verification Store  │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘   └────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 3. 🛠️ Technology Stack Breakdown

| Layer | Technology | Key Details & Capabilities |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Frontend Framework** | **Next.js 16 (App Router)** | Modern server/client component architecture, route prefetching, fast navigation. |
| **Frontend UI & Styling**| **React 19 + TailwindCSS v4** | Modern component lifecycle, Lucide icons, responsive layout system. |
| **Frontend State & Cache**| **Redux Toolkit + RTK Query** | Centralized cache, optimistic updates, automatic query re-fetching on mutations. |
| **Lineage Visualizer** | **HTML5 Canvas / Custom SVG** | Smooth pan & zoom, auto-branch layout, unlimited relative connectivity. |
| **Backend Framework** | **NestJS 11** | TypeScript-based modular framework, dependency injection, high scalability. |
| **API Documentation** | **Swagger UI / OpenAPI** | Interactive docs available at `/api/docs` with `Bearer` auth injection. |
| **ORM & Database** | **Prisma 7 + PostgreSQL** | `@prisma/adapter-pg` driver adapter, multi-file modular schema definitions. |
| **Caching & Sessions** | **Redis (`ioredis`)** | Token blacklist, fast session verification, rate limiting, and temporary codes. |
| **Email Service** | **Nodemailer (SMTP)** | Automated welcome emails, forgot password OTP links, and invite notices. |
| **Payments** | **Stripe API** | Multi-tier family subscriptions and billing webhooks. |

